  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "After migration of data from a Fedora 3.7.1 repository into a fresh Fedora 6 instance, the previously external datastreams of the F3 repo do exist as child nodes of the corresponding resources, however, upon accessing them an internal server error occurs. This, consulting the stack trace (see attached file), seems to be caused by a NullPointerException.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Some more information about the datastreams: They are, as mentioned, part of the External Reference control group, their MIME type is ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "em"
        }
       ],
       "text": "text/plain;charset=UTF-8",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ", they are in an active state and their versionability is set to replace older versions. An example for the referenced content (CMDI XML) can be seen ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://clarinws.informatik.uni-leipzig.de/cmdi2/cmdi/11022/0000-0007-D395-2/?showXml=true"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "here",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
