       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Peter Winckles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a4539889d5006a6c02f5\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a4539889d5006a6c02f5\" data-account-id=\"6089a4539889d5006a6c02f5\" accountid=\"6089a4539889d5006a6c02f5\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Felix Helfer</a>, if you'd like a hot-fix, you can use this branch I just made: <a href=\"https://github.com/pwinckles/migration-utils/tree/content-size\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/pwinckles/migration-utils/tree/content-size</a></p>\n\n<p>git clone -b content-size <a href=\"https://github.com/pwinckles/migration-utils.git\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/pwinckles/migration-utils.git</a></p>\n\n<p>After building that version of the migration-util, you'll need to do a fresh migration of your F3 objects.</p>\n\n<p>I am not planning on submitting a PR for this fix. Instead, we're going to change how content size is recorded so that it's not possible for it to have a null value. However, because we're trying to get an alpha release together, it is unlikely that this comprehensive fix will be made until sometime next week. Hopefully, this quick fix will unblock you for the time being.</p>\n\n<p>Let me know if you experience any other problems.</p>",
     "created": "09/Nov/20 3:39 PM",
